# monorepo version-file resolvers via Extracted.appendWithSession (legacy
# path) must keep the resolvers visible across every selected project's
# write. The promoted resolver must also retain a non-definitive project helper
# update and its delegated ThisBuild base when a later hook changes the target.
# That hook finishes with an empty Extracted.appendWithSession rebuild; the
# next cross-build switch must accept it without weakening replacement guards.
$ exec git init
$ exec git config user.email "test@example.com"
$ exec git config user.name "Test User"
